## 7. Lessons Learned

- Entra ID registration does not automatically mean a device is managed by Intune.
- Users require an eligible licence for Intune enrolment.
- Enrolment restrictions determine which devices can be enrolled.
- Device ownership classifications must reflect verified asset information.
- Administrators should not disable organisation-wide security restrictions to resolve an individual device issue.
- Successful enrolment does not automatically mean a device is compliant.
- Final verification should confirm both management and compliance status.

## 8. Ticket Closure

**Final Status:** Resolved

The laptop was successfully enrolled, evaluated as compliant and confirmed able to access approved corporate resources.

